A user class named after a built-in class (diag.class_name_collision,
warning): Email shadows the built-in only locally, confusing readers. The
Email{} instantiation inside the method is a use, not a declaration, and
must not flag.
-- input.ssl --
:CLASS Email;
:DECLARE oInner;

:PROCEDURE Constructor;
	Me:oInner := Email{};
:ENDPROC;

:PROCEDURE Send;
	:RETURN Me:oInner:Send();
:ENDPROC;
-- format --
